namespace pdg { /**

\fn pdg::SpriteLayer::layerToPortRect

\brief translate the rectangle (or RotatedRect) to account for the effective camera

Adjusts for the effective camera view and port anchor to get drawing coordinates.

Nonuniform scale or reflection returns enclosing bounds. For exact transformed corners, use the Quad conversion.

\param r Rect or RotatedRect in layer coordinates

\returns RotatedRect in port coordinates


**/ }